[1m# Definition lists[0m

A definition list is a paragraph
followed by lines that start with a
colon and a space.

[1m## One entry[0m

[1mtermd[0m
    A terminal markdown viewer.

[1m## Two terms, two definitions[0m

[1mColour[0m
[1mColor[0m
    The visual property of an object.
    A palette entry of a theme.

