[1m## Loose list[0m

[1mTight[0m
    No blank line before this
    definition.

[1mLoose[0m
    A blank line before this definition
    makes the whole list loose.

[1m## Several blocks[0m

[1mInstall[0m
    Build the binary from source.

    The second paragraph and a code
    block belong to the same definition:

    make build

[1m## Long definition[0m

[1mWrapping[0m
    This definition is long enough to
    wrap at every width of the golden
    files, and its wrapped lines start
    four columns to the right of the
    term.

